{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tyry-dot-hu-blue-silicone-pacifier-and-teething-chain-with-clip-sold-via-tiktok-2512-0118","content_id":"cd7594bc-3a04-4be7-a278-c7c5d3f1ee8c","description":"Product Safety Report for TYRY.HU Blue Silicone Pacifier and Teething Chain with Clip presenting a serious choking risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"39bfee49-6f77-4004-97d9-1a3e0b090059","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-12T16:28:27+00:00","id":"39bfee49-6f77-4004-97d9-1a3e0b090059","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-12T16:28:27+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693c42abcfacd5e888491f0f/2512-0118-product-safety-report-tyry.hu-blue-silicone-pacifier.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: TYRY.HU Blue Silicone Pacifier and Teething Chain with Clip sold via TikTok</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of choking as it has parts which can detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (TikTok).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Children’s articles and children’s equipment – Pacifiers/Teething Rings</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>TYRY.HU</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>“AAH0026-B + AAH0027-B” printed on the packaging label.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Blue silicone pacifier teething chain with clip supplied in blue cardboard packaging. Two products supplied per pack.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_39bfee49-6f77-4004-97d9-1a3e0b090059\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/693c42abcfacd5e888491f0f/2512-0118-product-safety-report-tyry.hu-blue-silicone-pacifier.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of choking as it has parts which can detach or break off during reasonably foreseeable use, creating a small part which fits entirely within a small parts cylinder. These small parts pose a choking hazard to young children, particularly those under 36 months of age who have a natural tendency to explore objects by placing them in their mouths.  </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (TikTok).</p>\n\n<p>TikTok have contacted consumers who have purchased the product to warn them of the risks.  </p>\n\n<p>We recommend owners stop using this product immediately. Contact the distributor you purchased from to request redress.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2512-0118</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Office for Product Safety and Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-12T16:50:24Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"childcare-articles-childrens-equipment","product_measure_type":["removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace","warning-consumers-of-risks"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-12","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-12T16:50:24+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tyry-dot-hu-blue-silicone-pacifier-and-teething-chain-with-clip-sold-via-tiktok-2512-0118","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tyry-dot-hu-blue-silicone-pacifier-and-teething-chain-with-clip-sold-via-tiktok-2512-0118","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tyry-dot-hu-blue-silicone-pacifier-and-teething-chain-with-clip-sold-via-tiktok-2512-0118","content_id":"cd7594bc-3a04-4be7-a278-c7c5d3f1ee8c","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-12-12T16:50:24Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: TYRY.HU Blue Silicone Pacifier and Teething Chain with Clip sold via TikTok (2512-0118)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-tyry-dot-hu-blue-silicone-pacifier-and-teething-chain-with-clip-sold-via-tiktok-2512-0118","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values